    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061123.0188\n\nBAGHDAD, Nov. 23 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nUrgent: Four explosions rock Baghdad's Sadr City\n\n\n\n\nFour explosions, including a car bomb at the 55th Square, in Baghdad's Shiite slum of Sadr City, took place on Thursday, an Interior Ministry source told Xinhua.",
